# W6 T6 comparator output

Regenerate: `python3 comparator.py --root . --out -`

Arms: `a00` = callback=off  trace=off   (unattached -- the shipped shape); `a10` = callback=count trace=off   (attached callback); `a01` = callback=off  trace=sink  (attached sink); `a11` = callback=count trace=sink  (both).

## The SQP corpus leg (the U0 27-cell set, one process per cell)

